  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "You there.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDo you wish to learn the ultimate in secret,\nmysterious techniques?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sorry, who are you?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F007200720079002C002000770068006F002000610072006500200079006F0075003F00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Go on, I’m listening<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F0020006F006E002C002000492019006D0020006C0069007300740065006E0069006E006700100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes, I think you look quite suited to this...\nVery well.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900650073002C002000490020007400680069006E006B00200079006F00750020006C006F006F006B002000710075006900740065002000730075006900740065006400200074006F00200074006800690073002E002E002E000A0056006500720079002000770065006C006C002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Charizard, Blaziken, Emboar, and Delphox...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBlastoise, Swampert, Feraligatr, and Greninja...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nVenusaur, Sceptile, Meganium, and Chesnaught...\nWhat do they all have in common?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 184
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Only they can learn the ultimate moves that I am\nwilling to teach you!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But to earn them, you’ll need to defeat trios of\nPokémon using only a single Pokémon of your<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nown—which I will specify.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Such are the trials that await you. Do you have\nwhat it takes to see them through?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you’d like to try, simply let me know.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006600200079006F0075201900640020006C0069006B006500200074006F0020007400720079002C002000730069006D0070006C00790020006C006500740020006D00650020006B006E006F0077002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So, you’re curious about my ultimate techniques.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F002C00200079006F007520190072006500200063007500720069006F00750073002000610062006F007500740020006D007900200075006C00740069006D00610074006500200074006500630068006E00690071007500650073002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In that case, three trials await you.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E0020007400680061007400200063006100730065002C00200074006800720065006500200074007200690061006C007300200061007700610069007400200079006F0075002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In each one, you must battle and defeat me using\nonly a single Pokémon of your own...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There is the Trial of Grass, where you’ll use\nMeganium to defeat three Fire-type Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The Trial of Fire will pit your Emboar against three\nWater-type Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And the Trial of Water calls upon you and your\nFeraligatr to defeat three Grass-type Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You must pass each trial to earn the right to learn\none of my ultimate techniques.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We can begin anytime you’re ready.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065002000630061006E00200062006500670069006E00200061006E007900740069006D006500200079006F0075201900720065002000720065006100640079002E00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Will you attempt a trial?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570069006C006C00200079006F007500200061007400740065006D007000740020006100200074007200690061006C003F00100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
